/**
 * Sanitizes the resource requirements ({@code requests} and {@code limits}) of the actual state so
 * that quantities which are numerically equal to the desired ones but expressed with a different
 * string format (e.g. {@code "1"} vs {@code "1000m"} or {@code "1024Mi"} vs {@code "1Gi"}) do not
